35,2,1,talk,Midori,,The last outage was unowned for two days. That is unacceptable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,We have no freeze window in winter. A cutover then is suicide.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,The dispatch tool skipped three upgrades. It is rotting.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Two admins retire this year. The hiring gap was eleven months.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Capital is cut, but operating costs pass easily. The trap is set.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, that explains why we keep buying add-ons.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, the yard scanners are a mess. New software must fit them.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if the admins leave, who maintains the new system?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, the supervisors ignored the last training. We need buy-in.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, the scope never survives a year. We need flexibility.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,We need a vendor who owns the whole stack.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,It must work with our old hardware and our calendar.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"We need a clean migration, not another data lift disaster.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"We need a partner who trains the supervisors, not just the admins.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,We need a fixed cost model. No surprise add-ons.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Midori,,A modular system might be too fragmented.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,A hosted suite might not handle our specific yard devices.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"A partner firm for migration sounds risky, given 2018.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,An on-site engineering team could help with the supervisors.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,A fixed configuration process sounds like a cost lock.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
